---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="The Second Spring – Your Perimenopause Companion" description="A private, compassionate companion for women navigating perimenopause.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="eyebrow">🌿 A new beginning, not an ending</div>
        <h1>Something's changing.<br/><em>You're not alone in it.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">Perimenopause can feel confusing, isolating, and invisible. The Second Spring is a private companion where you can ask anything, understand what's happening, and find your way forward.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Start Chatting — it's free</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-outline-white">How it works</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-trust">
          <span><span class="tick">✓</span> Anonymous & private</span>
          <span><span class="tick">✓</span> No judgement, no jargon</span>
          <span><span class="tick">✓</span> Available any time</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="disclaimer-strip">
    <div class="container">🔒 Information and support only — not medical advice. Always see your GP for personal health decisions.</div>
  </div>
  <section class="section white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="two-col">
        <div>
          <span class="label">Why now?</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">The years nobody talks about</h2>
          <p class="body-text">Perimenopause often starts in the late 30s or early 40s — years before most women expect it. Suddenly you're sleeping differently, feeling different, reacting differently. And nobody warned you.</p>
          <p class="body-text">Women come to us with questions like:</p>
          <ul class="question-list">
            <li>"Why am I so angry lately?"</li>
            <li>"Why can't I sleep through the night?"</li>
            <li>"Why do I feel anxious for no reason?"</li>
            <li>"My memory has changed — is that normal?"</li>
            <li>"My wife has completely changed. What's happening to her?"</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-panel">
          <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">4–10</div><div class="stat-label">years perimenopause typically lasts</div></div>
          <div class="stat-sep"></div>
          <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">30+</div><div class="stat-label">recognised perimenopause symptoms</div></div>
          <div class="stat-sep"></div>
          <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">Late 30s</div><div class="stat-label">when perimenopause can begin</div></div>
          <div class="stat-sep"></div>
          <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">Most</div><div class="stat-label">women are not warned it's coming</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section cream" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">How it works</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">A companion, not a chatbot</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Designed to listen first, then help you understand — and connect you with real support when you're ready.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-icon">💬</div><div class="step-title">You share what you're feeling</div><p class="step-desc">Choose a topic that resonates or just type what's on your mind. There's no wrong way to start.</p></div>
        <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-icon">🌿</div><div class="step-title">We listen and explain</div><p class="step-desc">Your companion responds with empathy first, then clear explanation. Plain language, no jargon.</p></div>
        <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-icon">🌸</div><div class="step-title">You find your next step</div><p class="step-desc">Whether understanding symptoms better or knowing what to say to your GP — we help you get there.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="label">Common experiences</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">What are you going through?</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Pick what resonates and we'll start there.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="symptom-grid">
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">😤</span><span class="symptom-label">Anger & irritability</span><span class="symptom-desc">Feeling short-fused or unlike yourself</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">💤</span><span class="symptom-label">Sleep problems</span><span class="symptom-desc">Waking in the night, exhausted by day</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">🔥</span><span class="symptom-label">Hot flushes</span><span class="symptom-desc">Sudden waves of heat, often at night</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">🧠</span><span class="symptom-label">Brain fog</span><span class="symptom-desc">Forgetting words, struggling to focus</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">📅</span><span class="symptom-label">Irregular periods</span><span class="symptom-desc">Cycles changing, skipping, or heavier</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">😔</span><span class="symptom-label">Anxiety & low mood</span><span class="symptom-desc">Unexplained sadness or nervousness</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">💑</span><span class="symptom-label">Supporting my partner</span><span class="symptom-desc">Understanding what she's going through</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="/chat" class="symptom-card"><span class="symptom-emoji">👩‍👧</span><span class="symptom-label">Worried about my mum</span><span class="symptom-desc">She seems different — could it be this?</span><span class="symptom-arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container cta-inner">
      <div>
        <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to begin your Second Spring?</h2>
        <p class="cta-desc">Private. Free. No sign-up required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/chat" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Open the Companion</a>
        <div class="cta-note">Anonymous • Available anytime • Not medical advice</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .hero { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1A3D2B 0%, #2A5C45 45%, #3D7A5F 100%); color: #fff; padding: 6rem 0 5rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 50% at 85% 30%, rgba(212,132,90,.25) 0%, transparent 65%); }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 680px; }
  .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2); padding: .35rem .9rem; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: #fff; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: #FBBF81; }
  .hero-desc { font-size: 1.08rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2.25rem; max-width: 560px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hero-trust { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; font-size: .87rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); }
  .tick { color: #7EE8A2; margin-right: .2rem; }
  .disclaimer-strip { background: var(--green-light); border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border); padding: .85rem 0; font-size: .84rem; color: var(--text-secondary); text-align: center; }
  .section { padding: 5rem 0; }
  .white { background: #fff; }
  .cream { background: var(--cream-mid); }
  .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .label { display: inline-flex; font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); padding: .3rem .85rem; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: .85rem; }
  .section-title { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: .75rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .section-subtitle { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; }
  .body-text { font-size: .97rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .two-col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; }
  .question-list { list-style: none; margin-top: .75rem; }
  .question-list li { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--text-secondary); padding: .5rem 0 .5rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light); position: relative; font-style: italic; }
  .question-list li::before { content: '"'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--peach); font-size: 1.2rem; font-style: normal; }
  .question-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .stat-panel { background: var(--green-light); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; }
  .stat-item { text-align: center; padding: 1rem 0; }
  .stat-num { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--green); letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .stat-label { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; }
  .stat-sep { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: .25rem 0; }
  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
  .step-card { background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; }
  .step-num { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: .92rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .step-icon { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .step-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .step-desc { font-size: .88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; }
  .symptom-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .symptom-card { background: var(--cream-mid); border: 1.5px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem; text-decoration: none; transition: all .2s; position: relative; }
  .symptom-card:hover { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(61,122,95,.12); }
  .symptom-emoji { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .symptom-label { font-weight: 700; font-size: .96rem; color: var(--text); }
  .symptom-desc { font-size: .83rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }
  .symptom-arrow { position: absolute; top: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; color: var(--green); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s; }
  .symptom-card:hover .symptom-arrow { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(3px); }
  .cta-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A3D2B 0%, #3D7A5F 100%); padding: 5rem 0; }
  .cta-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cta-title { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .cta-desc { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; align-items: flex-start; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .cta-note { font-size: .78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .cta-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; } .cta-actions { align-items: center; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .hero { padding: 4rem 0 3.5rem; } .section { padding: 3.5rem 0; } .symptom-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
